If you are using a third-party system to send messages or if you want journeys to send API calls to a third-party system, use custom actions to connect to your journey. For example, you can connect to the following systems with custom actions: Epsilon, Slack, [Adobe Developer](https://developer.adobe.com#_blank), Firebase, etc.

